+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_Ah2O0fLjFHZxJPsE09aq9405","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Contract: Document Management API\n2\t\n3\t## Behaviors & Verification\n4\t\n5\t### 1. User Registration\n6\t- **Behavior**: `POST /auth/register` with `{username, password}` creates a user and returns a token\n7\t- **Verify**: Status 201, response has `id`, `username`, `token`\n8\t- **Edge**: Missing fields → 400, duplicate username → 409\n9\t\n10\t### 2. User Login\n11\t- **Behavior**: `POST /auth/login` with valid `{username, password}` returns a token\n12\t- **Verify**: Status 200, response has `token`\n13\t- **Edge**: Wrong username → 401, wrong password → 401\n14\t\n15\t### 3. Auth Middleware\n16\t- **Behavior**: Protected routes return 401 without valid Bearer token\n17\t- **Verify**: No Authorization header → 401, bad token → 401, valid token → passes\n18\t\n19\t### 4. Folder CRUD\n20\t- **Behavior**: `POST /folders` creates a folder (auth required)\n21\t- **Verify**: Status 201, returns folder with `id`, `name`, `ownerId`, `parentId`, timestamps\n22\t- **Edge**: Missing name → 400, non-existent parentId → 404\n23\t\n24\t### 5. Get Folder\n25\t- **Behavior**: `GET /folders/:id` returns folder with its children\n26\t- **Verify**: Status 200, includes sub-folders and documents arrays\n27\t- **Edge**: Non-existent folder → 404, no access → 403\n28\t\n29\t### 6. Update Folder\n30\t- **Behavior**: `PUT /folders/:id` updates folder name (needs editor+)\n31\t- **Verify**: Status 200, returns updated folder\n32\t- **Edge**: No editor access → 403, non-existent → 404\n33\t\n34\t### 7. Delete Folder\n35\t- **Behavior**: `DELETE /folders/:id` deletes folder (needs owner)\n36\t- **Verify**: Status 204, folder removed from store\n37\t- **Edge**: No owner access → 403, non-existent → 404\n38\t- **Cascade**: Deletes nested content and their permissions\n39\t\n40\t### 8. Document CRUD\n41\t- **Behavior**: `POST /documents` creates document in a folder (needs editor+ on folder)\n42\t- **Verify**: Status 201, returns document with `id`, `title`, `content`, `folderId`, `ownerId`, timestamps\n43\t- **Edge**: Missing title or folderId → 400, non-existent folder → 404, no editor access on folder → 403\n44\t\n45\t### 9. Get Document\n46\t- **Behavior**: `GET /documents/:id` returns document\n47\t- **Verify**: Status 200, returns document\n48\t- **Edge**: Non-existent → 404, no viewer access → 403\n49\t\n50\t### 10. Update Document\n51\t- **Behavior**: `PUT /documents/:id` updates title/content (needs editor+)\n52\t- **Verify**: Status 200, returns updated document\n53\t- **Edge**: No editor access → 403, non-existent → 404\n54\t\n55\t### 11. Delete Document\n56\t- **Behavior**: `DELETE /documents/:id` deletes document (needs owner)\n57\t- **Verify**: Status 204\n58\t- **Edge**: No owner access → 403, non-existent → 404\n59\t\n60\t### 12. Sharing\n61\t- **Behavior**: `POST /share` with `{resourceType, resourceId, username, role}` shares resource\n62\t- **Verify**: Status 201, returns permission object\n63\t- **Edge**: Non-existent resource → 404, non-existent user → 404, no editor+ on resource → 403, invalid role → 400\n64\t\n65\t### 13. Effective Permissions\n66\t- **Behavior**: Viewer of a folder inherits access to documents inside it\n67\t- **Verify**: User shared as viewer on folder can GET documents in that folder\n68\t\n69\t### 14. Most Permissive Role Wins\n70\t- **Behavior**: Multiple permission paths yield the highest role\n71\t- **Verify**: User shared as viewer on folder AND editor on a doc inside it gets editor access on that doc\n72\t\n73\t### 15. Activity Log\n74\t- **Behavior**: `GET /activity` returns log entries (auth required)\n75\t- **Verify**: Status 200, returns array of entries with actionType, userId, targetType, targetId, timestamp, sorted newest-first\n76\t\n77\t### 16. Cascade Delete\n78\t- **Behavior**: Deleting a folder cascade-deletes all nested content\n79\t- **Verify**: After