ds editor+)\n- **Verify**: Status 200, returns updated folder\n- **Edge**: No editor access → 403, non-existent → 404\n\n### 7. Delete Folder\n- **Behavior**: `DELETE /folders/:id` deletes folder (needs owner)\n- **Verify**: Status 204, folder removed from store\n- **Edge**: No owner access → 403, non-existent → 404\n- **Cascade**: Deletes nested content and their permissions\n\n### 8. Document CRUD\n- **Behavior**: `POST /documents` creates document in a folder (needs editor+ on folder)\n- **Verify**: Status 201, returns document with `id`, `title`, `content`, `folderId`, `ownerId`, timestamps\n- **Edge**: Missing title or folderId → 400, non-existent folder → 404, no editor access on folder → 403\n\n### 9. Get Document\n- **Behavior**: `GET /documents/:id` returns document\n- **Verify**: Status 200, returns document\n- **Edge**: Non-existent → 404, no viewer access → 403\n\n### 10. Update Document\n- **Behavior**: `PUT /documents/:id` updates title/content (needs editor+)\n- **Verify**: Status 200, returns updated document\n- **Edge**: No editor access → 403, non-existent → 404\n\n### 11. Delete Document\n- **Behavior**: `DELETE /documents/:id` deletes document (needs owner)\n- **Verify**: Status 204\n- **Edge**: No owner access → 403, non-existent → 404\n\n### 12. Sharing\n- **Behavior**: `POST /share` with `{resourceType, resourceId, username, role}` shares resource\n- **Verify**: Status 201, returns permission object\n- **Edge**: Non-existent resource → 404, non-existent user → 404, no editor+ on resource → 403, invalid role → 400\n\n### 13. Effective Permissions\n- **Behavior**: Viewer of a folder inherits access to documents inside it\n- **Verify**: User shared as viewer on folder can GET documents in that folder\n\n### 14. Most Permissive Role Wins\n- **Behavior**: Multiple permission paths yield the highest role\n- **Verify**: User shared as viewer on folder AND editor on a doc inside it gets editor access on that doc\n\n### 15. Activity Log\n- **Behavior**: `GET /activity` returns log entries (auth required)\n- **Verify**: Status 200, returns array of entries with actionType, userId, targetType, targetId, timestamp, sorted newest-first\n\n### 16. Cascade Delete\n- **Behavior**: Deleting a folder cascade-deletes all nested content\n- **Verify**: After folder deletion, its documents and sub-folders are gone; permissions on deleted resources are cleaned up\n\n### 17. Owner Automatic Assignment\n- **Behavior**: Creator of a resource automatically has owner role\n- **Verify**: Creator can delete/modify their own resources without explicit sharing\n\n## Build Verification\n- `npm run build` → TypeScript compiles without errors\n- `npm run lint` → ESLint passes\n- `npm test` → All tests pass\n","numLines":89,"startLine":1,"totalLines":89}}}
